I basically want to build a framework that allows for an LLM to provide a chat interface to the user via HTML, a localhost HTML page, rather than just using the terminal to allow for the LLM to take advantage of modern UI components like flowcharts, visualization tools,
 that sort of thing, instead of just showing things in plain text in the terminal. The terminal also kind of makes it hard to ask the chatbot specific questions about a specific paragraph, and so I think having a HTML page that sort of acts as the interface for the user to interact with the LLM would be a great enhancement, and so I want to build out a framework that allows the LLM to do so. 
